---
// ThinkingStyles — Multiple ways of thinking beyond code
// Design, Strategy, Creativity, Technical, Collaborative
import Container from "./Container.astro";
---

<section class="section">
  <Container>
    <h2
      class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center animate-in"
      style="color: var(--fg);"
    >
      Plusieurs façons de penser.
    </h2>
    <p
      class="mt-4 text-center text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto animate-in"
      style="color: var(--fg-secondary); --delay: 0.1s;"
    >
      Nous ne sommes pas qu'un seul profil. Chaque projet mobilise différentes
      facettes de notre approche créative.
    </p>

    <div class="ts-grid mt-12">
      <!-- Design Thinking -->
      <div class="ts-card animate-in" style="--delay: 0.15s;">
        <div class="ts-card-top">
          <div class="ts-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="ts-tag">01</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ts-title">Design Thinking</h3>
        <p class="ts-desc">
          Placer l'humain au centre. Observer, empathiser, prototyper
          rapidement. Valider avant de construire.
        </p>
        <div class="ts-keywords">
          <span>Empathie</span>
          <span>Wireframe</span>
          <span>Test</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pensée Stratégique -->
      <div class="ts-card animate-in" style="--delay: 0.25s;">
        <div class="ts-card-top">
          <div class="ts-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M2 20h20M5 20V8l7-6 7 6v12M9 20v-6h6v6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="ts-tag">02</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ts-title">Pensée Stratégique</h3>
        <p class="ts-desc">
          Comprendre le marché, la concurrence, les objectifs business.
          Chaque choix visuel a un impact mesurable.
        </p>
        <div class="ts-keywords">
          <span>Positionnement</span>
          <span>Objectifs</span>
          <span>Métriques</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Créativité Visuelle -->
      <div class="ts-card animate-in" style="--delay: 0.35s;">
        <div class="ts-card-top">
          <div class="ts-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="ts-tag">03</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ts-title">Créativité Visuelle</h3>
        <p class="ts-desc">
          Explorer des directions inattendues. Typographie, couleur,
          composition — chaque pixel raconte une histoire.
        </p>
        <div class="ts-keywords">
          <span>Identité</span>
          <span>Typo</span>
          <span>Composition</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Approche Technique -->
      <div class="ts-card animate-in" style="--delay: 0.45s;">
        <div class="ts-card-top">
          <div class="ts-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="ts-tag">04</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ts-title">Approche Technique</h3>
        <p class="ts-desc">
          Du code propre et performant. Accessibilité, responsive,
          optimisation — la beauté ne s'arrête pas au maquettage.
        </p>
        <div class="ts-keywords">
          <span>Accessibilité</span>
          <span>Performance</span>
          <span>Clean code</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Collaboration -->
      <div class="ts-card ts-card--wide animate-in" style="--delay: 0.55s;">
        <div class="ts-card-top">
          <div class="ts-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="ts-tag">05</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ts-title">Collaboration</h3>
        <p class="ts-desc">
          Un projet réussi est un projet partagé. Communication transparente,
          retours iteratifs, co-création avec l'équipe client.
        </p>
        <div class="ts-keywords">
          <span>Ateliers</span>
          <span>Retours</span>
          <span>Co-création</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>

<style>
  .ts-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .ts-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s var(--ease-out-expo);
  }
  .ts-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-hover);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .ts-card--wide {
    grid-column: span 2;
  }

  .ts-card-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .ts-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--fg-secondary);
    transition: color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .ts-card:hover .ts-icon {
    color: var(--fg);
    border-color: var(--border-hover);
  }

  .ts-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .ts-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .ts-desc {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--fg-secondary);
  }

  .ts-keywords {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }
  .ts-keywords span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.5625rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .ts-card:hover .ts-keywords span {
    color: var(--fg-secondary);
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ts-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .ts-card--wide {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ts-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
    .ts-card--wide {
      grid-column: span 1;
    }
    .ts-card {
      padding: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
